<title>INDIA: India raises 31.25 bln rupees in 14-day t-bills.</title>
<headline>India raises 31.25 bln rupees in 14-day t-bills.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it issued 14-day treasury bills to a total face value of 31.25 billion rupees at its Thursday auction.</p>
<p>-- Bombay Newsroom (91) 22 265 9000;Fax (91) 22 2641699</p>
